<item>
            <title>[LU-20148] Purge directories in parallel in ltrash_purge</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20148</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Now ltrash_purge uses two-phase process to purge files and directories:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;phase1: purge files during tree walk&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;phase2: purge directories in DFS order in serial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;To improve directory deletion, we can build a directory list in phase1 and then do directory deletion in parallel in phase2, like MPIFileUtils drm does.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
